> ## Best immediate next step
> 
> Rather than trying to buy a whole keep, Ekemon could aim for a **ruined Redclaw watchtower** after dealing with Korga and Varkash’s contract.
> 
> The reward could be:
> 
> > “You now own **Titan Camp**, an abandoned watchtower overlooking Redclaw Cliffs. It has a cracked wall, one dry room, a dragon-shaped weather vane, and a locked cellar that occasionally thumps from below.”
> 
> Then Ekemon’s first choices are:
> 
> 1. **Fix the wall** — safer from raiders and monsters.  
> 2. **Build a training yard** — Varkash and Ekemon become a proper champion team.  
> 3. **Open the locked cellar** — probably Titan-related trouble and treasure.
